    <title>Deep Sets for Jet Flavour Tagging at the LHC</title>
    <summary>We present a permutation-invariant deep learning architecture for jet
    flavour tagging in high-pileup collider environments, and show that it improves
    trigger efficiency relative to sequential baselines.</summary>
